special_abilities:
  - name: "Intuitive Magic"
    description: "Spell knowledge comes from within, after years of contemplation. The outlook shapes the spells: a happy or optimistic mystic tends to helpful, healing, protective and defensive magic; one seeking power, wealth and prestige to aggressive and offensive magic; a dark view of the world to defensive and revealing spells with a few offensive ones. Six spells from levels 1-2 at first level, which cannot be changed; three from levels 1-3 at second level; three from levels 1-4 at third; two per level from fourth level on, from any spell level up to his own experience level. The mystic cannot learn spells independently, and is not likely to read symbols or runes or to perform rituals: he depends on his intuitive senses for all of his magic."
  - name: "Spell Strength"
    description: "+1 to spell strength (the number others must save against when you cast a spell) at levels four, eight and twelve."
